SUMMARY:BFCA Director's Welcome & Open House
DESCRIPTION:The team will lead new patrons on archival tours of our space
 \, share how we can support your research and interests\, and how you can
  support our mission as the sole repository in the world dedicated to Bla
 ck film. We are also excited to welcome returning IU and Bloomington comm
 unity members back to campus. If you're a cinephile or a history buff\, t
 his event is for you!&#160\;
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  The team will lead new patrons on archi
 val tours of our space\, share how we can support your research and inter
 ests\, and how you can support our mission as the sole repository in the 
 world dedicated to Black film. We are also excited to welcome returning I
 U and Bloomington community members back to campus. If you're a cinephile
  or a history buff\, this event is for you!&#160\;</p>
